        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qaybtii Dhulka Haray",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo shirkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhammu Shiiloh bay dhammaantood isugu soo urureen, oo waxay halkaas ka dhiseen teendhadii shirka; oo dadkii waddankana waa laga adkaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer binu Israa'iil dhexdooda waxaa ku hadhay toddoba qabiil oo aan weli helin qaybtii ay dhaxalka u lahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yashuuca wuxuu reer binu Israa'iil ku yidhi, Dalkii uu Rabbiga ah Ilaaha awowayaashiin idin siiyey ilaa goormaad ka raagaysaan inaad gashaan si aad dalka u hantidaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba qabiil walba saddex nin kala soo baxa; oo anigu iyaga waan diri doonaa, markaas waa inay kacaan, oo dalka dhex maraan, oo soo kala tilmaamaan siday u kala dhaxlayaan, oo markaas waa inay ii yimaadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waa inay dalka u kala qaybiyaan toddoba meelood. Reer Yahuudah waa inay degganaadaan soohdintooda ah xagga koonfureed, oo reer Yuusufna waa inay degganaadaan soohdintooda ah xagga woqooyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waa inaad dalka u soo kala tilmaantaan toddoba meelood, oo aad tilmaanta ii keentaan, oo markaasaan halkan idiinku saami ridi doonaa Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ah hortiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, reer Laawi dhexdiinna qayb dhaxal ah kuma laha; waayo wadaadnimada Rabbiga ayaa dhaxal u ah. Oo reer Gaad iyo reer Ruubeen iyo qabiilkii reer Manaseh badhkood waxay dhaxal u qaateen meel Webi Urdun ka shishaysa oo xagga bari ka xigta, oo Muuse oo addoonkii Rabbiga ahaa uu iyaga siiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa raggii kaceen oo tageen; oo kuwii tegey inay dalka soo tilmaamaan Yashuuca ayaa ku amray, oo ku yidhi, Taga oo dalka dhex mara, oo soo tilmaama, oo haddana aniga ii kaalaya, oo markaasaan halkan Shiiloh ah idiinku saami ridi doonaa Rabbiga hortiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay raggii tageen oo dalkii soo dhex mareen, oo waxay soo kala tilmaameen magaalooyinkii oo toddoba meelood u kala qaybsan, oo waxayna ku soo qoreen buug, oo markaasay u yimaadeen Yashuuca oo joogay xerada Shiiloh ku taal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yashuuca Shiiloh ugu saami riday iyagii Rabbiga hortiisa; oo halkaasaa Yashuuca reer binu Israa'iil ugu qaybshay dalkii sidii ay u kala qaybsanaayeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saamigii Reer Benyaamiin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qabiilkii reer Benyaamiin saamigoodii ay u heleen sidii ay reerahoodii kala ahaayeen ayaa u soo hor baxay; oo soohdintoodii ay saamiga u heleen waxay kala dhex mari jirtay reer Yahuudah iyo reer Yuusuf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo soohdintoodu xagga waaxda woqooyi waxay ka bilaabatay Webi Urdun; oo soohdintu waxay u baxday Yerixoo dhinaceeda woqooyi, oo waxay dhex martay dalka buuraha leh xaggiisa galbeed; oo dhammaadkeedii wuxuu u baxay cidladii Beytaawen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo soohdintu waxay halkaas uga gudubtay Luus (taasoo ah Beytel), iyo ilaa dhinaceeda koonfureed, oo soohdintu waxay ku dhaadhacday Cataarood Addaar, taasoo u dhow buurta ku taal Beytxooroonta hoose xaggeeda koonfureed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo soohdintu waxay u baxday oo ka laabatay waaxda galbeed xaggeeda koonfureed, iyo xagga buurta ku hor taal Beytxooroon xaggeeda koonfureed; oo soohdinta dhammaadkeedu wuxuu u baxay Qiryad Bacal taasoo ah Qiryad Yecaariim ee ahayd magaalo ay reer Yahuudah leeyihiin, intaasu waxay ahayd waaxdii galbeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waaxdii koonfureedna waxay ka bilaabatay meesha ugu fog Qiryad Yecaariim, oo soohdintu waxay martay xagga galbeed, oo waxay u baxday ishii biyaha ahayd oo Neftoo'ax; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo soohdintu waxay ku dhaadhacday meesha ugu fog buurta ku hor taal dooxadii ina Xinnom, taasoo ku taal xagga woqooyi oo dooxada reer Rafaa, oo waxay ku dhaadhacday ilaa dooxadii Xinnom, iyo ilaa dhinaca reer Yebuus xaggooda koonfureed, oo waxay kaloo sii martay Ceyn Rogeel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxay u leexatay xagga woqooyi, oo waxay martay Ceyn Shemesh agteeda; oo waxay u baxday Geliilood, taasoo ka soo hor jeedda jiirta Adummiim; oo haddana waxay u baxday dhagaxii Bohan ina Ruubeen; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxay sii martay dhinaca ka soo hor jeeda Caraabaah xaggeeda woqooyi, oo waxay ku dhaadhacday Caraabaah; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo soohdintu waxay sii martay Beytxoglaah dhinaceeda woqooyi; oo soohdinta dhammaadkeedu wuxuu ahaa xagga gacanka woqooyi oo Badda Cusbada leh, ee ku yaal Webi Urdun dhammaadkiisa koonfureed meesha uu ku dhammaado; intaasu waa soohdintii koonfureed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaxda bari soohdinteeduna waxay ahayd Webi Urdun. Intaasu waxay ahayd dhaxalkii reer Benyaamiin iyo soohdimihii ku wareegsanaa, ee ay u heleen sidii reerahoodu ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba magaalooyinkii reer Benyaamiin siday reerahoodu ahaayeen waxay ahaayeen Yerixoo, iyo Beytxoglaah, iyo Dooxadii Qesiis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Beytcaraabaah, iyo Semaarayim, iyo Beytel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Cawiim, iyo Faaraah, iyo Cofraah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Kefar reer Cammoon, iyo Cofnii, iyo Gebac, oo intaasu waa laba iyo toban magaalo iyo tuulooyinkoodii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Gibecoon, iyo Raamaah, iyo Bi'irod, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Misfaah, iyo Kefiiraah, iyo Mosaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Reqem, iyo Yirfe'eel, iyo Taralaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Seelac, iyo Elef, iyo Yebuus (taasoo ah Yeruusaalem), iyo Gibecaad, iyo Qiryaad, oo intaasu waa afar iyo toban magaalo iyo tuulooyinkoodii. Intaasu waa dhaxalkii reer Benyaamiin siday reerahoodii ahaayeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
